">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 2/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>LO6<br>Use general adverbial clauses appropriately in interpreting practice.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/003.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 3: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 3/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Activity: Interpreting Practice with ChatGPT<br>English–Vietnamese Interpretation<br>Topic: Health<br>Tool: ChatGPT for practice speeches</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/004.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 4: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 4/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Objectives<br>Practice interpreting short health speeches<br>Improve listening and speaking skills<br>Learn health-related vocabulary<br>Use ChatGPT as a learning partner</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/005.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 5: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 5/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Step 1: Ask ChatGPT for a Speech<br>Students ask ChatGPT:<br>Prompt example:“Please give a short speech (3–4 sentences) about healthy lifestyles.”<br>Students read or listen to the speech carefully.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/006.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 6: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 6/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Step 2: Note-Taking<br>While reading or listening, students write short notes:<br>Example notes:<br>exercise daily<br>healthy diet<br>drink water<br>reduce stress<br>Focus on keywords only.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/007.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 7: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 7/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Step 3: Interpretation<br>Students interpret the speech into Vietnamese.<br>Example sentence:<br>“Regular exercise helps people stay healthy and strong.”<br>Possible interpretation:Tập thể dục thường xuyên giúp mọi người khỏe mạnh và dẻo dai.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/008.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 8: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 8/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Pair Practice<br>Students work in pairs.<br>Student A: asks ChatGPT for a health topic speech<br>Student B: interprets the speech<br>Then switch roles<br>Example topics:<br>healthy eating<br>mental health<br>exercise habits</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/009.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 9: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 9/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Note-Taking Tip for Health Interpreting<br>Write keywords only, not full sentences.<br>Focus on:<br>Main ideas<br>Important nouns<br>Numbers or statistics<br>Example sentence:“Regular exercise and a healthy diet help prevent many diseases.”<br>Example notes:exercise – healthy diet – prevent – diseases</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/010.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 10: Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 10/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Unit 6. GENERAL ADVERBIAL CLAUSES<br>Tip:Use abbreviations and symbols to save time.<br>Examples:<br>health → hlth<br>doctor → dr<br>increase → ↑<br>decrease → ↓ 🩺✍️</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ELI302/flm1/d42/011.webp\" alt=\"ELI302 · ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 11: References\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">ELI302 SU26 updated session 35 · slide 11/11</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>References<br>Nolan, J. (2012). Interpretation: Techniques and exercises (2nd ed.). \tMultilingual Matters.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
